<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell - April 23 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell - April 23 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 16</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............812,300 up.....8,300</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......720,200 up.....1,000</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......558,700 down...1,400</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED APRIL 23</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....853,606 up ....7,942</p>
<p> Financial companies.......658,497 up.....8,431</p>
<p> New York business loans....46,124 down.....153</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......45,865 down.....148</p>
</text>
